          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa-angle-right fas" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><p>Free shuttle to Khao Sok village</p></div></span>
