        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Book Your Stay</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Riverside Cottages offers a peaceful riverside setting close to Khao Sok National Park, Cheow Lan Lake, jungle hikes, canoe trips, and local activities.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Thoughtful Jungle Living</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many aspects of Riverside Cottages have been designed to work with the surrounding environment rather than against it.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Raised walkways allow rainwater, plants, insects, and wildlife to move naturally beneath the resort while helping guests move comfortably around the property in all weather conditions. The cottages themselves are designed with high ceilings, natural ventilation, and open airflow instead of air conditioning, allowing guests to experience the sounds and atmosphere of the rainforest more closely.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Additional <a href="/sustainability/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">low-impact practices</a> include refill water stations, solar drying of laundry, locally sourced timber, and careful management of lighting and waste throughout the property.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Rafflesia Cafe</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-restaurant/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Rafflesia Cafe</a> overlooks the Sok River and serves breakfast, lunch, dinner, snacks, coffee, fruit shakes, cocktails, beer, and a mix of Thai and Western dishes throughout the day.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests often relax here between activities while watching monkeys across the river, listening to the sounds of the rainforest, or planning their next adventure in Khao Sok.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Many ingredients are sourced locally, while fresh bread is baked daily at the resort.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Tours & Activities</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our friendly local staff can help arrange a wide range of activities throughout Khao Sok including jungle hikes, canoe trips, <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Lan Lake tours</a>, floating bungalow overnights, tubing, elephant experiences, cooking classes, and family-friendly adventures.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Unlike many join-in tours in Khao Sok, our <a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">guided hikes</a> are arranged privately with our own local guides for couples, families, and groups travelling together.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Guests looking for the best value often choose one of our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">accommodation and activity packages</a>.
        </p>
